# What must not reach the image build (REVIEW-2026-09-17 S1).
#
# Without this file the whole checkout was the build context: 11 GB measured
# on 2026-09-18, of which the Flutter app's build output was 9.3 GB, and the
# build FAILED from a working checkout because the gitignored
# pubspec_overrides.yaml (absolute paths under one developer's home) and
# .dart_tool were copied in, so `pub get` looked for /home/grey/dev/fhir/...
# inside the container. A clean clone built; a developer's tree did not, and
# CI never built the image, so nobody ran test_docker.sh.

# Local pub state and overrides: pub get in the image resolves from
# pubspec.yaml and pubspec.lock alone.
**/.dart_tool
**/pubspec_overrides.yaml
**/.packages

# Build output, coverage, IDE files.
**/build
**/coverage
**/.idea
**/*.iml
.git

# Runtime state the server creates, and TLS material, never image content.
**/data
**/*.pem

# Packages the Dockerfile does not copy (the Flutter app and its plugins),
# and the review evidence under tool/.
packages/fhirant
packages/fhirant_secure_storage
packages/fhirant_server/tool/review_*
